### Get all notes
GET http://localhost:63404/api/notes
Accept: application/json

### Get note by its id
GET http://localhost:63404/api/notes/3e3e3009-95ad-4924-8063-b20d6f887d4a
Accept: application/json

### Update a note by its id
PUT http://localhost:63404/api/notes/3e3e3009-95ad-4924-8063-b20d6f887d4a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "International host",
  "content": "read, update"
}

### Delete a note by its id
DELETE http://localhost:63404/api/notes/3e3e3009-95ad-4924-8063-b20d6f887d4a
Accept: application/json